    "created_at": "2017-03-27T09:26:58Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-03-27T09:26:58Z",
    "body": "Talking with @nyaxt and @hiroshige-g we are all tentatively fans of the Edge and Firefox behavior. Notably there have been several bad XSS-related bugs in Chrome due to this code path, and since it seems likely web-compatible to just make scripts moving between documents never execute, we'd like to try that.\r\n\r\n@rniwa, if we can show that's web-compatible by shipping it in Chrome, does it seem like a reasonable thing for us to spec and for you to implement in WebKit?\r\n\r\n/cc @bzbarsky",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
